flowchart TD
    M[Incoming message from source j] --> Q{Message calibration action}
    Q -->|accept / correct / time_correct| O[Candidate cooperative objects]
    Q -->|downweight| O
    Q -->|quarantine| X[Suppress message unless peer recovery is allowed]

    O --> S{Object supported by peers?}
    S -->|support >= threshold| K[Keep or smooth object]
    S -->|support below threshold| R{Safety impact?}

    R -->|negative path-box margin or high waypoint impact| P{Recovery / admission rule}
    R -->|low impact| L[Ignore or keep low-risk object according to policy]

    P -->|fake object unsupported| QO[Object quarantine]
    P -->|missing object with peer evidence| MR[Missing recovery]
    P -->|one-source but path-risk critical| PR[Path-risk admission]
    P -->|persistent but not motion-consistent| TD[Temporal diagnostic only]

    K --> OUT[Calibrated perception output]
    L --> OUT
    QO --> OUT
    MR --> OUT
    PR --> OUT
    TD --> OUT

    OUT --> W[Waypoint collision evaluation]
    W --> T[Vehicle/message trust update]
    T --> M
